---
description: Go test standards — outer Test naming. Use with test-standards.
globs: "**/*_test.go"
alwaysApply: false
---

Apply these additions to **test-standards** when writing or editing Go tests (`*_test.go`).

**Naming**

- Outer `Test` name: `Test` + PascalCase of symbol under test, no underscores
  (e.g. `TestValidateLogSpec`, `TestCappValidatorHandle`).
